WEBVTT

00:13:29.084 --> 00:13:31.156
ali integriraju znanje žaba.

00:13:31.156 --> 00:13:32.491
A mi trebamo oboje.

00:13:32.491 --> 00:13:34.210
Problem je, Dyson je rekao,

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:36.909
što svima govorimo da postanu žabe.

00:13:36.909 --> 00:13:38.135
I ja smatram,

00:13:38.135 --> 00:13:39.611
u kaotičnom svijetu,

00:13:39.611 --> 00:13:41.786
to je sve kratkovidnije.

00:13:41.786 --> 00:13:43.102
Puno vam hvala.

00:13:43.102 --> 00:13:46.086
(Pljesak)